we’ll cover after this season of Westworld.

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:37.450
We’ll also do more videos on the Game of
Thrones books.

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:41.400
Author George Martin says he’s working to
finish the upcoming next book.

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:44.760
So now’s a good a time to read the series
– as well as the main books, there’s the

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:49.760
worldbook, the Dunk and Egg stories, and Fire
and Blood, which the upcoming prequel TV show

00:18:49.760 --> 00:18:51.330
is based on.

